# Config with real values (network layout, routing tables, etc.) is
# instance data, not code — .example.json templates ship inside the
# relevant plugin and/or get copied here by hand; only the real files
# living directly in config/ are ignored.
config/*.json
!config/*.example.json
config/*.md
scratch/
